{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adam is adrift, lost within the desolate, ever-shifting landscapes of his own mind. A past shrouded in trauma has ensnared him, transforming his subconscious into a battlefield of regret and fractured recollections. As you navigate this internal world, you carry the burden of Adam\u2019s fragmented experiences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You guide him through the surreal and often hostile manifestations of his psyche, where unsettling memories and profound fears take shape. This journey is a desperate search for clarity, a struggle against an encroaching darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Adam piece together the remnants of his understanding and find a path through the torment before he is entirely consumed?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922240?t=1754065858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922240?t=1754065858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922240/01c8044c1b34bffab7e8659c43634d4977768ec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754065858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922240/01c8044c1b34bffab7e8659c43634d4977768ec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754065858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"\"Norah's Song\" explores profound themes of mental anguish, PTSD, guilt, and loss. The game contains unsettling imagery and psychological horror that may disturb some players. It may also potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Viewer discretion is strongly advised. \u00a0 "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adam is adrift, lost within the desolate, ever-shifting landscapes o